{"seq":2,"slug":"hash-bitmap-indexes","title":"哈希索引与位图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/structures/hash-bitmap-indexes","wordCount":1649,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"哈希索引与位图索引\">哈希索引与位图索引</h1><p>B+ 树是通用六边形战士，但它不是每场战斗的最优解。当查询只关心「等于某个值」、完全不需要范围和排序时，哈希索引能把代价压到接近常数级；当一列只有寥寥几个取值、却经常和其他列组合着筛选时，位图索引能用纯位运算把多条件查询做到极致。这两种结构都是「放弃通用性、换取在特定场景下碾压 B 树」的特化选手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>哈希索引与位图索引都是「放弃通用性、换取特定场景碾压 B 树」的特化结构，判断它们各自的位置，看三个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>最擅长的查询</th>\n<th>彻底放弃的能力</th>\n<th>典型落点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希索引</td>\n<td>纯等值查找，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>范围、排序、前缀匹配</td>\n<td>内存 KV、自适应哈希</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位图索引</td>\n<td>低基数列的多条件与或非</td>\n<td>高频单行更新（写代价高）</td>\n<td>数据仓库 / OLAP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>哈希</strong>用散列把等值查找压到与行数无关的常数级，但打散了有序性，凡是要「比大小」的查询都做不了；此外还需处理冲突。</li>\n<li><strong>位图</strong>为低基数列的每个取值建一条等长位串，多条件组合退化为 CPU 最快的按位运算，但整列压缩存储使单行更新代价极高。</li>\n<li>两者的共同点是<strong>适用边界很窄</strong>：只有在查询形态严格匹配时才划算，一旦偏离就远不如 B+ 树的通用性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"哈希索引-等值查询的极致\">哈希索引：等值查询的极致</h2><p>哈希索引的思想直接来自哈希表：把被索引列的值通过哈希函数算出一个槽位，键值对就存在那个槽里。查找时对查询值算同样的哈希，一步跳到对应槽，平均时间复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与表的行数无关——这比 B+ 树的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 更进一步。</p>\n<p>但这份速度的代价是彻底放弃有序性。哈希把值打散到各个槽里，相邻的值落在毫不相关的位置，于是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>范围查询（<code>&gt;</code> <code>&lt;</code> <code>BETWEEN</code>）完全做不到——哈希不知道谁大谁小。</li>\n<li>排序（<code>ORDER BY</code>）用不上索引。</li>\n<li>前缀匹配（<code>LIKE &#39;abc%&#39;</code>）也无能为力。</li>\n<li>哈希冲突需要处理（链地址法或开放寻址），极端情况下性能退化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正因如此，哈希索引在主流数据库里往往不是默认、甚至不直接对外开放。InnoDB 有「自适应哈希索引」（adaptive hash index），由引擎自动为热点 B+ 树页面在内存里建哈希加速等值查找，开发者无法手动指定。PostgreSQL 则提供显式的 <code>HASH</code> 索引类型，但实践中很少用——因为 B+ 树的等值查找已经够快，而且还附赠了范围能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哈希与-b-树的取舍\">哈希与 B+ 树的取舍</h2><p>到底什么时候哈希索引才真正划算？关键看查询是否「纯等值、且追求极致延迟」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>哈希索引</th>\n<th>B+ 树索引</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等值查询</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，最快</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序 / 前缀</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存 vs 磁盘</td>\n<td>偏好内存（如 Redis、Memcached）</td>\n<td>磁盘友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>精确键查找、内存 KV</td>\n<td>通用，关系库默认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个清晰的判断：内存型 KV 存储（Redis 的字典、Memcached）天然用哈希，因为它们的访问模式就是纯键查找；而磁盘上的关系型数据库默认 B+ 树，因为绝大多数业务查询迟早会用到范围、排序或前缀，B+ 树的「通用」远比哈希的「极致等值」更值钱。优化器在等值查询上选哪条访问路径，回到了 <a href=\"../foundations/access-paths\">访问路径与索引使用</a> 的代价比较逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位图索引-低基数列的逆袭\">位图索引：低基数列的逆袭</h2><p>上一章 <a href=\"../foundations/index-concepts\">索引核心概念</a> 里说过，「性别」「订单状态」这类<a href=\"../foundations/index-concepts\">选择性</a>极低的列，普通 B+ 树索引几乎没用。但位图索引偏偏就是为它们而生的。</p>\n<p>位图索引为列的每一个不同取值建一个位图（bitmap）——一个长度等于表行数的二进制位串，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位为 1 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行的该列等于这个值。比如「性别」列有「男/女」两个值，就建两个位图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"gender = 男:  1 0 1 1 0 0 1 ...&#10;gender = 女:  0 1 0 0 1 1 0 ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>gender = 男:  1 0 1 1 0 0 1 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gender = 女:  0 1 0 0 1 1 0 ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它的杀手锏是多条件组合查询。<code>WHERE gender = &#39;男&#39; AND status = &#39;已付款&#39;</code> 直接退化成两个位图做按位与（AND）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>结果位图</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>bitmap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>男</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>bitmap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>已付款</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{结果位图} = \\text{bitmap}(gender=男) \\;\\&amp;\\; \\text{bitmap}(status=已付款)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">结果位图</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bitmap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">男</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">&amp;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bitmap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已付款</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>OR</code> 对应按位或、<code>NOT</code> 对应按位取反。位运算是 CPU 最快的操作之一，几个条件「与或非」一组合，瞬间就筛出结果集。这正是上一章「位图索引扫描」访问路径的底层机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;WHERE gender=&#39;男&#39;&lt;br/&gt;AND status=&#39;已付款&#39;&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;读位图&lt;br/&gt;gender=男&lt;br/&gt;1 0 1 1 0 0 1&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; B2[&quot;读位图&lt;br/&gt;status=已付款&lt;br/&gt;1 1 0 1 0 1 1&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; AND[&quot;按位 AND&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; AND&#10;    AND --&gt; RES[&quot;结果位图&lt;br/&gt;1 0 0 1 0 0 1&lt;br/&gt;→ 第 1,4,7 行命中&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"WHERE gender='男'&lt;br/&gt;AND status='已付款'\"] --&gt; B1[\"读位图&lt;br/&gt;gender=男&lt;br/&gt;1 0 1 1 0 0 1\"]\n    Q --&gt; B2[\"读位图&lt;br/&gt;status=已付款&lt;br/&gt;1 1 0 1 0 1 1\"]\n    B1 --&gt; AND[\"按位 AND\"]\n    B2 --&gt; AND\n    AND --&gt; RES[\"结果位图&lt;br/&gt;1 0 0 1 0 0 1&lt;br/&gt;→ 第 1,4,7 行命中\"]</pre><h2 id=\"位图索引的适用边界\">位图索引的适用边界</h2><p>位图索引在数据仓库和 OLAP 系统（如 Oracle、Greenplum、ClickHouse 的相关结构）里大放异彩，但在 OLTP 系统里几乎是禁区。原因是更新代价：位图是为整列状态压缩存储的，改动一行的某个值，可能要锁定并重写一大片位图，并发更新时锁冲突严重。</p>\n<p>因此位图索引的适用条件相当苛刻：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>列基数低（取值种类少，几个到几千个）。</li>\n<li>数据以批量加载为主、几乎不做单行更新（典型的数据仓库负载）。</li>\n<li>查询大量使用多列条件的「与或非」组合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当这三条都满足时，位图索引的多条件查询性能可以远超多个 B+ 树索引的组合；一旦涉及高频更新或高基数列，它就彻底不合适。如何在这些结构之间做选型，是 <a href=\"../design/index-selection\">索引选择与取舍</a> 要系统回答的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>哈希索引把等值查找压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但完全放弃范围、排序和前缀能力，且需处理哈希冲突；适合内存 KV 和纯等值场景。</li>\n<li>主流关系库默认用 B+ 树而非哈希，因为「通用」（兼顾范围/排序）比「极致等值」对业务更有价值；InnoDB 的自适应哈希由引擎自动管理。</li>\n<li>位图索引为低基数列的每个取值建一个位串，多条件组合查询直接退化为快速的按位与/或/非运算。</li>\n<li>位图索引适合数据仓库（低基数、批量加载、多条件组合查询），但单行更新代价高，几乎不用于 OLTP。</li>\n<li>这两种结构都是「牺牲通用性换特定场景碾压」的特化选手，选型时要严格匹配查询形态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哈希索引与位图索引","id":"哈希索引与位图索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希索引：等值查询的极致","id":"哈希索引-等值查询的极致"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希与 B+ 树的取舍","id":"哈希与-b-树的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"位图索引：低基数列的逆袭","id":"位图索引-低基数列的逆袭"},{"level":2,"text":"位图索引的适用边界","id":"位图索引的适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"B 树与 B+ 树索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/structures/btree-indexes"},"next":{"title":"LSM 树索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/structures/lsm-indexes"}}